[[image:Cat03.jpg|thumb|고양이 (''goyang-i'')]]

===Etymology===
From older {{ko-l|괴}} (Pronounced as 고이 koy in the 15c) + obsolete suffix [[-앙이]](small things). First recorded in 1690, and became popular at the late 19th century.

